Type: Package
Package: bs4Dashkit
Title: Branding, Theming, and Navigation Utilities for 'bs4Dash'
    Dashboards
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("George", "Arthur", , "prigasgenthian48@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides branding, theming, and navigation utilities for
    applications built with 'bs4Dash' and 'shiny'. Supports configurable
    sidebar brand display modes, hover-expand behavior, and theme
    customization using CSS variables. Includes standardized navigation
    components such as refresh and help controls, along with helpers for
    common navbar and footer layouts.
